<title>ITALY: ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL TRAINING TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL TRAINING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>VAL GARDENA, Italy 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times in</p>
<p>Thursday's second training session for men's Alpine skiing</p>
<p>World Cup downhills on Friday and Saturday:</p>
<p> 1. Werner Franz (Austria)   2 minutes 01.31 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Josef Strobl (Austria)	     2:01.49</p>
<p> 3 equal. Hannes Trinkl (Austria)    2:02.00</p>
<p> 3 equal. Fritz Strobl (Austria)     2:02.00</p>
<p> 5. Kristian Ghedina (Italy)	   2:02.01</p>
<p> 6. Pietro Vitalini (Italy)	    2:02.18</p>
<p> 7. Rob Boyd (Canada)		    2:02.24</p>
<p> 8. Franco Cavegn (Switzerland)	2:02.58</p>
<p> 9. Luc Alphand (France)		 2:02.64</p>
<p> 10 equal. Adrien Duvillard (France) 2:02.80</p>
<p> 10 equal. Kyle Rasmussen (U.S.)     2:02.80</p>
